Snapshots can be stored losslessly using versioned, checksummed Zstandard
level 1 compression by setting ``dataset.snapshot_compression`` to ``"zstd"``.
Compressed and uncompressed snapshots are always readable, and snapshot APIs and
NetCDF exports return the complete JSON. Uncompressed snapshots, the default,
can be read by all QCoDeS versions; compressed snapshots can only be read by
QCoDeS 0.64.0 and later. No database upgrade is required.
